cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BOLTRA, please cite this software release and the underlying BoltzGen software."
title: "BOLTRA: BoltzGen Orchestration Layer for Targeted design and Results Analysis"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
authors:
  Olanrewaju Ayodeji Durojaye, Soukayna Baammi, Mohamed Moussaoui, Salaheddine EL HADAD, Loubna ALIMOUSSA, Rachid BENHIDA, Rachid Daoud
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  BOLTRA is an independent, menu-driven orchestration, recovery, residue-mapping,
  and post-design analysis layer for BoltzGen workflows spanning peptide,
  cyclotide, protein-binder, protein-redesign, small-molecule-binder, nanobody,
  and antibody design.
keywords:
  - protein design
  - BoltzGen
  - peptide design
  - antibody design
  - computational structural biology
